# Proteus Chromium patch series — applied top-to-bottom.
# Methodology: small, single-purpose, rationale-headed patches (ungoogled-chromium
# / Camoufox style) so a rebase conflict localizes to one surface and its guarding
# probes are known. See docs/tdd/01-chromium-engine.md §2 and docs/tdd/05 §3.
#
# Layers:
#   layer0  de-Google (upstream-ish, stable)
#   layer1  fingerprint config plumbing + native surfaces (our core IP)
#   layer2  anti-automation
#
# M0 note: layer0 references the ungoogled-chromium series we adopt wholesale;
# layer1/layer2 ship here as documented placeholders with full rationale headers,
# to be implemented against a real Chromium tree in M1. check-series.mjs validates
# that every entry below exists and carries the required headers.

